    "Cloud view projects valid depth pixels through camera intrinsics into a lightweight camera-coordinate point preview. It is a point cloud, not cloud storage, cloud compute, or a semantic word cloud." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点云视图使用相机内参，将有效深度像素投影为轻量的相机坐标系点预览。这里的点云并非云存储、云计算或语义词云。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Combined score from flatness, inlier ratio, and selected plane size." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "由平整度、内点比例和所选平面大小综合得出的评分。"
