            "value" : "显示已完成矩形选择的测量结果和预览。在深度视图中，所选裁剪区域仅使用局部有效深度样本重新着色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows numeric depth measurements for the selected region, including median depth, range, valid samples, and any local plane estimate." : {
